E`, so the ground-truth `.so` is\nbuilt with **no** optimisation flags. Because the `double`→`unsigned long long`\nconversion this library depends on is lowered by the compiler (and is UB for most\ninputs), the whole suite was additionally replayed against C rebuilt at `-O0`,\n`-O1`, `-O2`, `-O3` and `-Os` — all pass. Point the harness at an alternate C\nbuild with the `IMA_C_SO` environment variable:\n\n```sh\ngcc -shared -fPIC -O2 -o /tmp/libO2.so c_src/src/lib.c -Ic_src/include -Ic_src/src\nIMA_C_SO=/tmp/libO2.so cargo test\n```"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5342,"cache_read_input_tokens":194749,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5342,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3786f768-af92-404b-a5c1-7f882bb95312","uuid":"0dae0d56-720a-4f62-8e16-191833c3c466","timestamp":"2026-08-19T13:29:19.754Z"}
